    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\left(x+\\dfrac52\\right)^2-\\dfrac{17}{4}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+5x+2&=\\left(x+\\frac52\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+2\\\\x^2+5x+2&=\\left(x+\\frac52\\right)^2-\\frac{17}{4}.\\end{align*}$$",
